  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7b669ec4189a9b5",
      "translationZh": "本示例展示了如何使用新的 Hugging Face LLM Inference Container，将 BLOOM 等开源大语言模型部署到 Amazon SageMaker 上进行推理。我们将部署 12B Pythia Open Assistant Model，这是一个使用 Open Assistant 数据集训练的开源聊天大语言模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad1acafb17b3c059",
      "translationZh": "本示例涵盖：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "173afa28f99f0c98",
      "translationZh": "设置开发环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "20d60ee025fe235b",
      "translationZh": "获取新的 Hugging Face LLM DLC",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "64c0c650efcad7be",
      "translationZh": "将 Open Assistant 12B 部署到 Amazon SageMaker",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "87323c785ddd0216",
      "translationZh": "运行推理并与我们的模型聊天",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4c3f9e2327ae2489",
      "translationZh": "创建由 Amazon SageMaker 提供后端支持的 Gradio 聊天机器人",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecb3260877fd89e3",
      "translationZh": "你也可以在 notebooks 仓库中找到本示例的代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "144c099c28abf6a9",
      "translationZh": "什么是 Hugging Face LLM Inference DLC？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc27c41cfd98c753",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face LLM DLC 是一种全新、专门构建的推理容器，可在安全且受管理的环境中轻松部署 LLM。该 DLC 由 Text Generation Inference（TGI）提供支持，TGI 是一种专为部署大型语言模型（LLM）并提供模型服务而构建的开源解决方案。TGI 利用张量并行和动态批处理，为最受欢迎的开源 LLM 实现高性能文本生成，包括 StarCoder、BLOOM、GPT-NeoX、Llama 和 T5。Text Generation Inference 已被 IBM、Grammarly 和 Open-Assistant 倡议等客户采用，并针对所有受支持的模型架构实现了优化，包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "608a9fae13f0ec84",
      "translationZh": "张量并行和自定义 cuda 内核",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "92d898078245e5c1",
      "translationZh": "针对最受欢迎的架构，使用 flash-attention 优化用于推理的 transformers 代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "687d18bd047db8ab",
      "translationZh": "使用 bitsandbytes 进行量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8c2cc7321067c5e8",
      "translationZh": "对传入请求进行连续批处理，以提高总体吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed07df7c7209e47a",
      "translationZh": "使用 safetensors 加速权重加载（缩短启动时间）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "12fce3f025b28714",
      "translationZh": "Logits 变换器（温度缩放、topk、重复惩罚等）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3af24d9a73e67ba4",
      "translationZh": "使用《大语言模型水印》（A Watermark for Large Language Models）中的方法添加水印",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "227671255ff8a739",
      "translationZh": "停止序列、对数概率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "67e8349cf970b51d",
      "translationZh": "使用服务器发送事件（Server-Sent Events，SSE）进行词元流式传输",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2841157b927571f1",
      "translationZh": "目前官方支持的模型架构有：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4d4b13c8a499e85",
      "translationZh": "借助 Amazon SageMaker 上全新的 Hugging Face LLM Inference DLCs，AWS 客户可以利用与 HuggingChat、OpenAssistant 以及面向 Hugging Face Hub 上 LLM 模型的 Inference API 相同的底层技术，获得高并发、低延迟的 LLM 体验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9aad22f274a733b1",
      "translationZh": "让我们开始吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a1ffaa859f334223",
      "translationZh": "1. 设置开发环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bedc648fa2e0538",
      "translationZh": "我们将使用 sagemaker python SDK 将 BLOOM 部署到 Amazon SageMaker。我们需要确保已配置好 AWS 账户，并安装了 sagemaker python SDK。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db68353139fa4a89",
      "translationZh": "如果你打算在本地环境中使用 Sagemaker，就需要能够访问一个具有 Sagemaker 所需权限的 IAM Role。你可以在此处了解更多相关信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "db645a1d52dbe307",
      "translationZh": "2. 获取新的 Hugging Face LLM DLC",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d64a7e8d640219a",
      "translationZh": "与部署常规 Hugging Face 模型相比，我们首先需要获取容器 uri，并通过指向该镜像的 image_uri 将其提供给 HuggingFaceModel 模型类。要在 Amazon SageMaker 中获取新的 Hugging Face LLM DLC，我们可以使用 sagemaker SDK 提供的 get_huggingface_llm_image_uri 方法。此方法允许我们根据指定的后端、会话、区域和版本，获取所需 Hugging Face LLM DLC 的 URI。你可以在此处查看可用版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "781505d8928d31d0",
      "translationZh": "3. 将 Open Assistant 12B 部署到 Amazon SageMaker",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf1d6754af37c87b",
      "translationZh": "注意：Amazon SageMaker 的配额可能因账户而异。如果你收到提示已超出配额的错误，可以通过 Service Quotas 控制台提高配额。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c4dd030b6720a76",
      "translationZh": "要将 Open Assistant Model 部署到 Amazon SageMaker，我们会创建一个 HuggingFaceModel 模型类，并定义端点配置，包括 hf_model_id、instance_type 等。我们将使用 g5.12xlarge 实例类型，该实例配备 4 块 NVIDIA A10G GPU 和 96GB GPU 显存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f6f80e514846788",
      "translationZh": "注意：我们也可以针对成本优化部署，使用 g5.2xlarge 实例类型并启用 int-8 量化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b9acd5781f5a70b",
      "translationZh": "创建 HuggingFaceModel 后，我们可以使用 deploy 方法将其部署到 Amazon SageMaker。我们将使用 ml.g5.12xlarge 实例类型来部署模型。TGI 会自动将模型分发并分片到所有 GPU 上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "817e9ff3cec46f60",
      "translationZh": "SageMaker 现在将创建我们的端点，并将模型部署到该端点。此过程可能需要 5-10 分钟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "685c2ed9480522a1",
      "translationZh": "4. 运行推理并与我们的模型聊天",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c76758fbd03e48e3",
      "translationZh": "端点部署完成后，我们可以使用 predictor 的 predict 方法在该端点上运行推理。我们可以使用不同的参数来控制生成过程，并在 payload 的 parameters 属性中定义这些参数。截至目前，TGI 支持以下参数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "66cab00f87299883",
      "translationZh": "temperature：控制模型的随机性。较低的值会使模型更具确定性，较高的值则会使模型更具随机性。默认值为 1.0。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f9ebb84cbeb31b2",
      "translationZh": "max_new_tokens：要生成的最大 token 数。默认值为 20，最大值为 512。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4c3c239ad09ab6fe",
      "translationZh": "repetition_penalty：控制重复出现的可能性，默认值为 null。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aa30a46e0e8f6378",
      "translationZh": "seed：用于随机生成的种子，默认值为 null。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2101d928c7e01ba5",
      "translationZh": "stop：用于停止生成的词元列表。当生成其中任一词元时，生成就会停止。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ee36df2f8481b9f",
      "translationZh": "top_k：进行 top-k 过滤时要保留的概率最高的词表词元数量。默认值为 null，表示禁用 top-k 过滤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "87fce0b06fd3eaee",
      "translationZh": "top_p：进行核采样时要保留的概率最高的词表词元的累积概率，默认值为 null。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9a51a515fa0ba54",
      "translationZh": "do_sample：是否使用采样；否则使用贪心解码。默认值为 false。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b119795d78d00e96",
      "translationZh": "best_of：生成 best_of 个序列，并返回词元对数概率最高的那个序列，默认值为 null。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bcc2084abce35df3",
      "translationZh": "details：是否返回有关生成的详细信息。默认值为 false。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b811601966008b7",
      "translationZh": "return_full_text：是返回完整文本，还是仅返回生成的部分。默认值为 false。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3bd42a074bee009",
      "translationZh": "truncate：是否将输入截断至模型的最大长度。默认值为 true。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c6cb6e67fe0b60c2",
      "translationZh": "typical_p：词元的典型概率。默认值为 null。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7cc59a6848dd83b5",
      "translationZh": "watermark：生成时使用的水印。默认值为 false。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b35a21573fbd475",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 swagger 文档中找到 TGI 的开放 API 规范。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3963743c7046be43",
      "translationZh": "OpenAssistant/pythia-12b-sft-v8-7k-steps 是一个对话聊天模型，这意味着我们可以使用以下提示词与它聊天：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b484d6b21129e31",
      "translationZh": "让我们先试一试，问问它夏天可以做些什么有趣的事情：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10156d9a2d3b0f42",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们将展示如何在载荷的 parameters 属性中使用生成参数。除了设置自定义的 temperature、top_p 等参数外，我们还会在机器人的这一轮回复结束后停止生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bd6d4b7905a0446b",
      "translationZh": "5. 创建由 Amazon SageMaker 支持的 Gradio 聊天机器人",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d6caccd17a3e7ec",
      "translationZh": "我们还可以创建一个 gradio 应用程序来与模型聊天。Gradio 是一个 python 库，可让你快速为机器学习模型创建可自定义的 UI 组件。你可以在这里了解有关 gradio 的更多信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f993021db6f92f2",
      "translationZh": "太棒了！🚀 我们已成功将 Open Assistant Model 部署到 Amazon SageMaker，并使用它运行了推理。此外，我们还快速构建了一个 gradio 应用，用于与我们的模型聊天。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7868a2b1b130dc0",
      "translationZh": "现在，轮到你亲自尝试，使用 Amazon SageMaker 上全新的 Hugging Face LLM DLC 构建生成式 AI 应用了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08a1ca358c19c5e3",
      "translationZh": "要清理资源，我们可以删除模型和端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "039eca9761179047",
      "translationZh": "全新的 Hugging Face LLM Inference DLC 使客户能够在 Amazon SageMaker 上轻松、安全地部署开源 LLM。易于使用的 API 和部署流程让客户能够利用 Open Assistant 等最先进的模型，构建可扩展的 AI 聊天机器人和虚拟助手。总的来说，这款全新的 DLC 将助力开发者和企业利用自然语言生成领域的最新进展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d56adfaff91acdc",
      "translationZh": "感谢阅读！如果你有任何问题，欢迎随时通过 Twitter 或 LinkedIn 联系我。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "LLMs",
      "briefZh": "大语言模型",
      "explanationZh": "大型语言模型的缩写，指能够理解和生成自然语言的模型。"
    },
    {
      "term": "inference",
